WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.620 --> 00:00:47.220
[ Music ]

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.440
[Doctor:] Why pick on this machinist?

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:57.820
[ Music ]

00:00:57.820 --> 00:01:01.139
Why pick on this sales girl?

00:01:01.139 --> 00:01:03.269
[ Music ]

00:01:03.269 --> 00:01:06.329
Why pick on this housewife?

00:01:06.329 --> 00:01:08.580
[ Music ]

00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:10.649
Why pick on this student?

00:01:10.649 --> 00:01:11.750
[Music]

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:21.260
Well, we didn't. But TB did. TB? What is TB?
TB is tuberculosis. 

00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:27.220
It's catching. It respects no age, sex, class or race.

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:33.100
TB breeds in neglect. Overcrowding.  

00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:35.139
Bad housing conditions.

00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:41.540
But TB can be anywhere. In the slums or on the avenue.

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:47.440
It thrives on ignorance of the facts. It is
insidious. Tireless. 

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:52.719
It can exist unknown among you because it shows no outward signs.

00:01:53.620 --> 00:01:57.580
Of course you're healthy. You think it can't
happen to you. 

00:01:58.140 --> 00:02:00.400
But TB might happen to you.

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:08.780
Without warning! Once it catches up with you,
TB can slow you down to a standstill.

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:21.780
You can't see the TB germ with the naked eye.

00:02:21.960 --> 00:02:28.620
But here, behind the scenes, these people know what it looks like.

00:02:28.630 --> 00:02:33.170
On the slide under the microscope, are some
germs coughed up by a TB patient. 

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:37.140
How about it doctor, may we have a look?

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:46.980
Here it is. The tubercle bacillus. The germ
that causes tuberculosis. 

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:51.420
Medical scientists study the effect of the tubercle bacillus...

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:55.780
the TB germ that destroys vital tissues of
the human body. 

00:02:56.060 --> 00:03:02.480
Always seeking weapons to combat the invader. Here's the kind of damage it does.

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:08.370
And it is only when TB is well along that
it shows itself in unexplained tiredness,

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:11.150
loss of weight, coughing. 

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:14.480
And importantly, spitting up blood.

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:24.630
This hand belongs to a person who has TB.

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:28.040
You may think he looks like this.

00:03:30.420 --> 00:03:37.520
But...the hand belongs to him. Surprised you. So does TB.

00:03:37.740 --> 00:03:41.140
You see in the early stages, TB masquerades.

00:03:41.540 --> 00:03:46.240
You can't tell it and neither can the other fellow.

00:03:46.349 --> 00:03:51.099
This man doesn't deliberately mean to endanger
the lives of those with whom he works, 

00:03:51.099 --> 00:03:55.379
but spray containing TB germs scatters several feet away. 

00:03:55.960 --> 00:04:00.940
Reaches the nose and mouth of a healthy person. That's you!

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:10.280
The home, with its close family contacts is
the ideal ground for spreading TB germs.

00:04:11.300 --> 00:04:19.120
But remember, you're not born with TB. You get it from someone who has it.

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:27.860
[ Music ]

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:35.660
Everything this parent uses and touches in
the home may spread deadly TB germs.

00:04:35.980 --> 00:04:43.340
Yet all the while, he is completely unaware that he is exposing his family to infection.

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:52.180
Dancing, music, romance, all will soon be
forgotten if this girl has picked up TB

00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:58.620
from her father. For sooner or later she will spread the disease to others.

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:04.339
[Applause and music]

00:05:04.339 --> 00:05:19.939
[ Music ]

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:26.580
This is the way she sees him. But behind the familiar face, in that healthy body,

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:29.380
what's the inside story?

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:35.620
Only the doctor can tell if you have TB. And
there's a chance, remember, that you do have it.

00:05:35.960 --> 00:05:38.540
He'll give you a complete physical examination.

00:05:38.550 --> 00:05:45.550
A tuberculin test, if indicated, and most
important of all, a chest x-ray. 

00:05:45.960 --> 00:05:49.880
Without x-ray, many people today would still be in the dark...

00:05:49.889 --> 00:05:53.889
become sick before they knew they had TB. 

00:05:54.060 --> 00:06:02.300
Only the x-ray can look behind that picture of health you present and see what's underneath.

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:05.060
[ Music ]

00:06:05.060 --> 00:06:08.180
What's that doctor? A shadow that shouldn't
be there? 

00:06:08.520 --> 00:06:11.800
Lucky you found it before it got any worse.

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:16.160
[ Music ]

00:06:16.169 --> 00:06:20.449
When you had that picture taken, you did yourself a favor.

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:26.660
And by going to the sanatorium, you'll do your family a favor.

00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:31.710
Where there's TB discovered in the early stages,
a patient can walk into the sanatorium

00:06:31.710 --> 00:06:38.360
under his own power, and be pretty certain of walking out again alive and well.

00:06:39.320 --> 00:06:45.360
True, he is isolated in the sanatorium nearest
to his home. But it's a friendly isolation.

00:06:45.520 --> 00:06:50.840
He's with fellow patients whose problems and
objectives are the same as his own.

00:06:50.920 --> 00:06:55.560
[ Music ]

00:06:55.620 --> 00:07:00.440
His family and friends are free to visit him.
And he is taught that...

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:10.280
the treatment for TB is rest in bed. Plus, good food; fresh air.

00:07:10.289 --> 00:07:13.889
In the sanatorium, the TB patient learns how to live.

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:18.340
Food is selected to meet the requirements of the individual patient.

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:25.340
He is given periodic examinations. His physical
condition is constantly studied by his doctor.

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:32.480
He gets the best medical and nursing care.

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:36.400
Surgery if he needs it.

00:07:36.660 --> 00:07:40.320
[ Music ]

00:07:40.330 --> 00:07:47.330
And the thing vital to his peace of mind.
He doesn't spread TB to those he loves.

00:07:48.509 --> 00:07:55.509
If the old job is too strenuous, the patient
is in the right spot to train for a new job.

00:07:55.560 --> 00:07:59.599
[ Music ]

00:07:59.599 --> 00:08:07.579
Occupational therapy? Yes. The practical kind that prepares the patient for work that he enjoys.

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:13.200
Worthwhile work that he can handle
without endangering his future health.

00:08:13.620 --> 00:08:20.000
[ Music ]

00:08:23.280 --> 00:08:30.280
Time, rest, and relaxation can work wonders.

00:08:30.800 --> 00:08:34.520
By following his doctor's orders, this man got well.

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:39.120
[ Music ]

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:43.600
Nice going there! And now to keep well.

00:08:46.160 --> 00:08:53.120
You can do it! But remember, you must check
with your doctor regularly.

00:08:58.940 --> 00:09:06.380
From coast-to-coast. From border-to-border and over the border in cities, towns, on farms...

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:12.480
TB is present. Right now at least half a million Americans have TB.

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:17.740
The death toll is well over 50,000
lives each year.

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:25.200
If you want to avoid TB, find out where you
can get a chest x-ray. 

00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:27.240
Get one now. 

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:32.300
Urge everyone you know to have one.

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:39.140
[ Music ]

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:43.360
Make a chest x-ray a part of your thorough
physical checkup. 

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:50.500
Have that checkup at least once a year. You'll live longer.

00:09:50.720 --> 00:09:58.640
[ Music ]

00:10:00.360 --> 00:10:03.700
Who is the next patient, doctor? 

00:10:03.980 --> 00:10:08.040
He isn't always the person in the waiting room.

00:10:08.049 --> 00:10:10.420
[ Music ]

00:10:12.080 --> 00:10:15.560
The next patient might be that man crossing
the street.

00:10:15.560 --> 00:10:19.740
[ Music ]

00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:25.949
Maybe he should be heading this way. To make
sure he hasn't got TB.

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:32.940
That's it. You'll never regret your action
mister. You're on the beam. 

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:37.200
And you're traveling in the right direction.

00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:50.300
[ Music ]

